 / substrates *</label><input id=\"eq-application\" name=\"application\" placeholder=\"e.g. kraft paper to paper tube\" required maxlength=\"180\"><small>Which materials are being joined?</small></div><div class=\"field full\"><label for=\"eq-message\">Process and requirement *</label><textarea id=\"eq-message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"Tell us about your process, current challenge, and any relevant conditions.\" required minlength=\"15\" maxlength=\"2000\"></textarea></div></div><div class=\"form-actions\"><p>Build a concise requirement brief to share with the team.</p><button class=\"btn btn-blue\" type=\"submit\">Prepare enquiry →</button></div></form><div class=\"prepared\" aria-live=\"polite\"><h3>Request prepared.</h3><p>Copy your requirement brief to share with the team.</p><pre id=\"enquiry-summary\"></pre><div class=\"prepared-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-blue\" id=\"copy-enquiry\" type=\"button\">Copy request</button><button class=\"btn btn-white\" id=\"edit-enquiry\" type=\"button\">Edit details</button></div><p class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\"></p></div></div><div class=\"family-options\" id=\"product-options\" role=\"listbox\" aria-label=\"Product family\" hidden><button type=\"button\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"Synthetic adhesives\"><span>Synthetic adhesives</span><small>Paper · packaging · lamination</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"Starch based adhesives\"><span>Starch based gums</span><small>Tubes · cores · corrugation</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"Wood working adhesives\"><span>Wood working</span><small>Furniture · interiors</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"Packaging / paper conversion\"><span>Packaging / paper conversion</span><small>Paper formats and board</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"option\" aria-selected